					},
					"text": {
						"type": "text",
						"value": "FIND\n\nThe Find node can be used to find a substring(the Needle) in a string(the Haystack). The node will output a boolean(true) if the neelde is found within the haystack.\n\nThe start from inlet allows you to tell the node from which position in the haystack to start searching.\n\nIn the node panel you will find an option to look for either the first or last occurrence of the neelde. "
					}
				},
